            <p>China's cosmetic surgery market has experienced explosive growth, becoming the <strong>third largest</strong> in the world after the United States and Brazil. According to the China Association of Plastics and Aesthetics, over <strong>1.2 million rhinoplasty procedures</strong> were performed in 2025, with a compound annual growth rate of 18% since 2020.</p>

